WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.560
I mean, you're much closer to the city.

00:01.560 --> 00:03.820
We have an ocean in between.

00:03.820 --> 00:05.420
You're right there.

00:05.420 --> 00:07.660
And Europe has to step it up.

00:07.660 --> 00:09.400
They can't be doing what they're doing.

00:09.400 --> 00:11.180
They're buying oil and gas from Russia.

